    SPACE / W / UP  -  Jump  (tap again for Double Jump)

    S
    / DOWN (hold)  -  Crouch under red lasers

    ESC  -  Pause


    <b>GOAL</b>

    Collect
    5 gold stars to clear the level.


    <b>ITEMS</b>

    <color=#FFD54A>Gold
    Star</color>  -  counts toward the level goal (+score)

    <color=#39FF6A>Green
    Chevron</color>  -  SPEED RUSH: faster, huge score, unlimited jumps

    <color=#FF4A4A>Red
